        },
        {
          "text": "Ubususithi kibo: INkosi yamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Nathani lidakwe, lihlanze, liwe, lingaphindi livuke futhi, ngenxa yempi engiyithumela phakathi kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
