          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba sengiqalile ukwenza okubi emzini lapho ibizo lami lidunyiselwa khona; lizayekelwa ukutshaywa na? Atshi, kaliyikuyekelwa, ngoba ngibiza impi ezabehlela bonke abakhileyo emhlabeni, kutsho iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
